xt, using the triangle inequality, simplifying, and substituting in the given information, we have \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2\\sqrt{3}‖u‖+‖u+v‖ & \\le 2\\sqrt{3}‖u‖+(‖u‖+‖v‖) \\\\  & =2\\sqrt{3}‖u‖+(‖u‖+2\\sqrt{3}) \\\\  & =(2\\sqrt{3}+1)‖u‖+2\\sqrt{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nCombining the two inequalities, we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}12\\sqrt{3} & \\le (2\\sqrt{3}+1)‖u‖+2\\sqrt{3} \\\\ 10\\sqrt{3} & \\le (2\\sqrt{3}+1)‖u‖ \\\\ \\frac{10\\sqrt{3}}{2\\sqrt{3}+1} & \\le ‖u‖.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the smallest possible value of $‖u‖$ is $\\frac{10\\sqrt{3}}{2\\sqrt{3}+1}.$" 13194139535018 true] [17592186327097 1000 #edb/ref 17592186327098 13194139535018 true] [17592186327097 1000 #edb/ref 17592186327099 13194139535018 true] [17592186327097 1000 #edb/ref 17592186327100 13194139535018 true] [17592186327097 1000 #edb/ref 17592186327101 13194139535018 true] [17592186327097 1000 #edb/ref 17592186327102 13194139535018 true] [17592186327097 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535018 true] [17592186327097 1041 "selection" 13194139535018 true] [17592186327097 1104 #edb/ref 17592186327100 13194139535018 true] [17592186327097 1110 #uuid "777f9c3f-2deb-540b-a837-731ef9a1e092" 13194139535018 true] [17592186327098 1034 "10\\sqrt{3}" 13194139535018 true] [17592186327098 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535018 true] [17592186327098 1111 #uuid "f0b35cbf-5529-51a5-bcc1-557a65d58c3e" 13194139535018 true] [17592186327099 1034 "\\frac{10\\sqrt{3}}{2\\sqrt{3}}" 13194139535018 true] [17592186327099 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535018 true] [17592186327099 1111 #uuid "dae480ff-090f-5697-897d-db490c2677b8" 13194139535018 true] [17592186327100 1034 "\\frac{10\\sqrt{3}}{2\\sqrt{3}+1}" 13194139535018 true] [17592186327100 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535018 true] [17592186327100 1111 #uuid "657f1701-472e-5f66-9fb0-790a0ebddd04" 13194139535018 true] [17592186327101 1034 "6" 13194139535018 true] [17592186327101 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535018 true] [175921